Third-party programs in the built boot image
--------------------------------------------

The boot image (out/halium14/boot-ut.img) is not part of this repository,
but it combines the following with the files above:

- the Linux kernel built from the tree above with kernel/patches (GPL-2.0);
- busybox 1.37.0, Alpine busybox-static 1.37.0-r31 for aarch64 (GPL-2.0);
- UBports' unified recovery ramdisk for Halium 14 (various licences, mostly
  Apache-2.0 and GPL);
- patched copies of UBports binaries, made at build time from the exact
  package versions in the Ubuntu Touch root filesystem:
  lomiri-telephony-service-handler (GPL-3.0) and Halium's
  libaudioclient.so (Apache-2.0); and hci_vhci.ko from the kernel (GPL-2.0).

tools/fetch-inputs.sh lists where each input comes from, pinned by SHA256.
docs/roadmap-release.md, item 4, tracks the corresponding sources that have
to be published with a release.
